WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:09.652
This is the Evidence Index — ninety-four data files, one hundred and fifty investigation pages, twenty-eight verified government sources, and zero hallucinations.

00:00:09.602 --> 00:00:18.000
Every claim on this site traces directly to a government database: Health Canada, Elections Canada, the Commissioner of Lobbying, or the Auditor General.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.579
No data is fabricated, estimated, or assumed.

00:00:21.579 --> 00:00:28.272
If a number appears, it has a verifiable source — and that is what makes this archive so dangerous to the people named in it.
